WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.079
Week 14: Travel, Transport, and Lodging. reserve transport and lodging check in report delays and room problems

2
00:00:08.079 --> 00:00:14.217
Mission brief. Complete a multi-leg trip despite a delay and a missing reservation.

3
00:00:14.217 --> 00:00:23.601
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:31.296
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:31.296 --> 00:00:39.738
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:39.738 --> 00:01:10.113
Model language. Voy a completar un viaje con varias etapas. — I am going to complete a multi-leg trip. Hay un retraso en el primer tramo. — There is a delay on the first leg. Mi reserva está ausente en el sistema. — My reservation is missing from the system. A pesar del problema, continúo el viaje. — Despite the problem, I continue the trip. Resuelvo cada etapa con un plan alternativo. — I resolve each leg with a backup plan.

7
00:01:10.113 --> 00:01:19.862
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
